cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ScholarRAG"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Scholarag2026/scholarrag-v1.1.0"
abstract: >-
  An open-source retrieval-augmented research platform for literature screening
  and citation-grounded drafting. Retrieval draws exclusively on OpenAlex.
  An optional Web of Science
  journal-level venue filter is followed by LLM title-and-abstract screening,
  with an exportable screening record. Generated text is checked with
  record-level checks against Crossref and claim-level checks of drafted
  statements against the cited full text.
